Please, add a module doc-string before `/-- Finite additive telescope over `Ico n m` in any additive commutative
    group: `∑ i ∈ Ico n m, (g (i + 1) - g i) = g m - g n`.

Used by `em2_finite` to collapse the sum of the per-period endpoint
differences `f′(j+1) − f′(j)` into `f′(m) − f′(n)`. `n = m` is the
reflexive base case. -/
theorem ico_sum_telescope (g : ℕ → 𝕜) (n m : ℕ) (hnm : n ≤ m) : ∑ i ∈ Finset.Ico n m, (g (i + 1) - g i) = g m - g n :=
  by
  refine Nat.le_induction ?_ ?_ m hnm
  · simp
  · intro p _ IH
    have hsplit : Finset.Ico n (p + 1) = insert p (Finset.Ico n p) :=
      by
      ext i
      simp [Finset.mem_Ico]
      omega
    rw [hsplit, Finset.sum_insert (by simp [Finset.mem_Ico]), IH]
    abel`.

